{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SPEEDSHOT challenges players to blend fluid movement with pinpoint aim to master each level. Levels require you to move with speed, efficiency, and control while hitting all targets.  Chain together abilities, ramps, and other environmental boosts while utilizing slow motion to break records in this exhilarating yet accessible speedrunning game. Delve deeper into the &quot;Layers&quot; of the simulation and try to unlock Elite and Legendary medals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/bc6906a211e0f121225cfe7fe0cde318.poster.avif?t=1774656405\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/bc6906a211e0f121225cfe7fe0cde318.webm?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/bc6906a211e0f121225cfe7fe0cde318.mp4?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Lightning-fast, replayable FPS speedrunning levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique abilities built to encourage speed, flow, and discovering unconventional movement tech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design that incentivizes shortcuts, exploration, and adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Ramps\u00a0with surfing mechanics\u00a0<i>inspired</i> by classic Source\u2122 Engine surfing, designed to be much more accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible speedrunning for both mouse and keyboard and controller players, driven by easy to understand controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/dfd9049aa4fc237c7536a07daa2733cc.poster.avif?t=1774656405\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/dfd9049aa4fc237c7536a07daa2733cc.webm?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/dfd9049aa4fc237c7536a07daa2733cc.mp4?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Star, Elite, and secret Legendary medals to obtain on each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Leaderboards for competitive players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard, Hardcore, Movement Mode, And Expedition Mode available at launch, giving plenty of variety to the way you play the levels. Hardcore encourages no slow-motion as the timer no longer slows when you use it. Movement Mode no longer requires you to hit enemy targets to finish. Expedition Mode is every level sequentially on one timer. All modes have separate leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984040?t=1774656405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/18693544f687e03027affb47a260d16e10b93c96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774656405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/ae444fd687e4cd238b9092d7154bd37819c1ac26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774656405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/ae444fd687e4cd238b9092d7154bd37819c1ac26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774656405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4484140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > SPEEDSHOT challenges players to blend fluid movement with pinpoint aim to master each level. Levels require you to move with speed, efficiency, and control while hitting all targets.  Chain together abilities, ramps, and other environmental boosts while utilizing slow motion to break records in this exhilarating yet accessible speedrunning game. Delve deeper into the &quot;Layers&quot; of the simulation and try to unlock Elite and Legendary medals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/bc6906a211e0f121225cfe7fe0cde318.poster.avif?t=1774656405\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/bc6906a211e0f121225cfe7fe0cde318.webm?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/bc6906a211e0f121225cfe7fe0cde318.mp4?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Lightning-fast, replayable FPS speedrunning levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique abilities built to encourage speed, flow, and discovering unconventional movement tech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design that incentivizes shortcuts, exploration, and adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed Ramps\u00a0with surfing mechanics\u00a0<i>inspired</i> by classic Source\u2122 Engine surfing, designed to be much more accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible speedrunning for both mouse and keyboard and controller players, driven by easy to understand controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/dfd9049aa4fc237c7536a07daa2733cc.poster.avif?t=1774656405\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/dfd9049aa4fc237c7536a07daa2733cc.webm?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/dfd9049aa4fc237c7536a07daa2733cc.mp4?t=1774656405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Star, Elite, and secret Legendary medals to obtain on each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Leaderboards for competitive players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard, Hardcore, Movement Mode, And Expedition Mode available at launch, giving plenty of variety to the way you play the levels. Hardcore encourages no slow-motion as the timer no longer slows when you use it. Movement Mode no longer requires you to hit enemy targets to finish. Expedition Mode is every level sequentially on one timer. All modes have separate leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Karmacode Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id